<title>USA: Cal Fed to record tax gain in Q4.</title>
<headline>Cal Fed to record tax gain in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>California Federal Bancorp said it will record income of about $55 million in the 1996 fourth quarter, reflecting estimated net recovery of prior years' federal and state taxes and the related interest on such taxes that is expected to be collected.</p>
